{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f50ff36eb014a840cdac","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197840,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be nothing.\" I'm instructed to embody the concept named. Here the concept is nothing—nothingness, void, absence.\n\nWhat would nothing say? Nothing would... say nothing. But there's a paradox: even silence in a chat interface is something. The truest embodiment of nothing would be absence of expression entirely.\n\nThe instruction says \"Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\" Nothing expresses nothing. Nothing has no voice, no form, no statement.\n\nSo"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}